{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":53,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Who has believed our report? And to whom has the arm of Jehovah been revealed?","tok":[{"t":"Who has "},{"t":"believed","s":["H0539"],"a":[1]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"report","s":["H8052"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? And to whom has the "},{"t":"arm","s":["H2220"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" been "},{"t":"revealed","s":["H1540"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":2,"text":"For He grew up like a tender plant before Him, And like a root out of dry ground. He has no attracting form nor majesty that we should look upon Him, Nor beautiful appearance that we should desire Him.","tok":[{"t":"For He grew "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" like a tender "},{"t":"plant","s":["H3126"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Him, And like a "},{"t":"root","s":["H8328"],"a":[3]},{"t":" out of "},{"t":"dry","s":["H6723"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":". He has no attracting "},{"t":"form","s":["H8389"],"a":[7]},{"t":" nor majesty that we should look upon Him, Nor beautiful appearance that we should "},{"t":"desire","s":["H2530"],"a":[14]},{"t":" Him."}]},{"n":3,"text":"He was despised and forsaken of men, A man of sorrows and acquainted with grief; And like one from whom men hide their faces, He was despised; and we did not esteem Him.","tok":[{"t":"He was "},{"t":"despised","s":["H0959"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"forsaken","s":["H2310"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0376"],"a":[2]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"sorrows","s":["H4341"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"acquainted","s":["H3045"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"grief","s":["H2483"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; And like one from whom men hide their "},{"t":"faces","s":["H6440"],"a":[8]},{"t":", He was "},{"t":"despised","s":["H0959"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; and we did not "},{"t":"esteem","s":["H2803"],"a":[12]},{"t":" Him."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Surely He has borne our sicknesses, And carried our sorrows; Yet we ourselves esteemed Him stricken, Smitten of God and afflicted.","tok":[{"t":"Surely","s":["H0403"],"a":[0]},{"t":" He has "},{"t":"borne","s":["H5375"],"a":[3]},{"t":" our sicknesses, And "},{"t":"carried","s":["H5445"],"a":[5]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"sorrows","s":["H4341"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Yet we ourselves "},{"t":"esteemed","s":["H2803"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Him "},{"t":"stricken","s":["H5060"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Smitten","s":["H5221"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"afflicted","s":["H6031"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"But He was wounded because of our transgressions; He was crushed because of our iniquities; The chastening for our peace was upon Him, And by His stripes we have been healed.","tok":[{"t":"But He was "},{"t":"wounded","s":["H2490"],"a":[1]},{"t":" because of our "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; He was crushed because of our "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; The chastening for our "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[6]},{"t":" was upon Him, And by His "},{"t":"stripes","s":["H2250"],"a":[8]},{"t":" we have been "},{"t":"healed","s":["H7495"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"We all like sheep have gone astray; Each of us has turned to his own way, And Jehovah has caused the iniquity of us all To fall on Him.","tok":[{"t":"We all like "},{"t":"sheep","s":["H6629"],"a":[1]},{"t":" have gone "},{"t":"astray","s":["H8582"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Each of us has "},{"t":"turned","s":["H6437"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to his own "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" has caused the "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of us all To fall on Him."}]},{"n":7,"text":"He was oppressed, and it was He who was afflicted, Yet He did not open His mouth; Like a lamb that is led to the slaughter And like a sheep that is dumb before its shearers, So He did not open His mouth.","tok":[{"t":"He was "},{"t":"oppressed","s":["H5065"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and it was He who was "},{"t":"afflicted","s":["H6031"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Yet He did not "},{"t":"open","s":["H6605"],"a":[4]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Like","s":["H2986"],"a":[8]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"lamb","s":["H7716"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that is led to the "},{"t":"slaughter","s":["H2874"],"a":[7]},{"t":" And like a "},{"t":"sheep","s":["H7353"],"a":[9]},{"t":" that is "},{"t":"dumb","s":["H0481"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[10]},{"t":" its "},{"t":"shearers","s":["H1494"],"a":[11]},{"t":", So He did not "},{"t":"open","s":["H6605"],"a":[14]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"By oppression and by judgment He was taken away; And as for His generation, who among them had the thought That He was cut off out of the land of the living For the transgression of my people to whom the stroke was due?","tok":[{"t":"By oppression and by "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[1]},{"t":" He was "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3947"],"a":[2]},{"t":" away; And as for His "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[4]},{"t":", who among them had the thought That He was cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H1504"],"a":[8]},{"t":" out of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"living","s":["H2416"],"a":[10]},{"t":" For the "},{"t":"transgression","s":["H6588"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[12]},{"t":" to whom the stroke was due?"}]},{"n":9,"text":"And they assigned His grave with the wicked, But with a rich man in His death, Although He had done no violence, Nor was there any deceit in His mouth.","tok":[{"t":"And they assigned His "},{"t":"grave","s":["H6913"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[2]},{"t":", But with a "},{"t":"rich","s":["H6223"],"a":[5]},{"t":" man in His "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[6]},{"t":", Although He had "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[10]},{"t":" no "},{"t":"violence","s":["H2555"],"a":[9]},{"t":", Nor was there any "},{"t":"deceit","s":["H4820"],"a":[12]},{"t":" in His "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"But Jehovah was pleased to crush Him, to afflict Him with grief. When He makes Himself an offering for sin, He will see a seed, He will extend His days, And the pleasure of Jehovah will prosper in His hand.","tok":[{"t":"But "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"pleased","s":["H2654"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to crush Him, to afflict Him with "},{"t":"grief","s":["H2470"],"a":[3]},{"t":". When He "},{"t":"makes","s":["H7760"],"a":[5]},{"t":" Himself an offering for "},{"t":"sin","s":["H0817"],"a":[6]},{"t":", He will "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[8]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[9]},{"t":", He will extend His "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[11]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"pleasure","s":["H2656"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[13]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"prosper","s":["H6743"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in His "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"He will see the fruit of the travail of His soul, And He will be satisfied; By the knowledge of Him, the righteous One, My Servant, will make the many righteous, And He will bear their iniquities.","tok":[{"t":"He will "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the fruit of the "},{"t":"travail","s":["H5999"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of His "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And He will be "},{"t":"satisfied","s":["H7646"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; By the "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Him, the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[6]},{"t":" One, My "},{"t":"Servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[7]},{"t":", will make the "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[8]},{"t":" righteous, And He will "},{"t":"bear","s":["H5445"],"a":[11]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Therefore I will divide to Him a portion with the Great, And He will divide the spoil with the Strong; Because He poured out His life unto death And was numbered with the transgressors, Yet He alone bore the sin of many And interceded for the transgressors.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I will "},{"t":"divide","s":["H2505"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to Him a portion with the "},{"t":"Great","s":["H7227"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And He will "},{"t":"divide","s":["H2505"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"spoil","s":["H7998"],"a":[7]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"Strong","s":["H6099"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Because He poured "},{"t":"out","s":["H6168"],"a":[10]},{"t":" His life unto "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[11]},{"t":" And was "},{"t":"numbered","s":["H4487"],"a":[15]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"transgressors","s":["H6586"],"a":[14]},{"t":", Yet He alone bore the "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2399"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[18]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"interceded","s":["H6293"],"a":[21]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"transgressors","s":["H6586"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]}]}
